---
# clang-format configuration for this repo: the LLVM standard.
#
# `BasedOnStyle: LLVM` pins clang-format's built-in default style, so every
# option resolves to the LLVM defaults, notably:
#   - IndentWidth: 2 (one indentation level = two spaces)
#   - ColumnLimit: 80
#   - BreakBeforeBraces: Attach (braces share the line of the if/for/while/
#     function header)
#   - PointerAlignment: Right, SortIncludes: true
#
# Contract: any supported C++ file in this repo (src/, tests/) must be
# clang-format clean. Verify before a milestone with:
#   clang-format --dry-run --Werror src/*.cpp src/*.h tests/*.cpp
# See also `clang-format --dump-config --style=LLVM` for the full expansion.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM